  "notes": "{生|う}み{出|だ}す combines {生|う}む (to give birth, to produce) and {出|だ}す (to put out).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Transitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n- Takes を particle: 〜を{生|う}み{出|だ}す\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- アイデアを{生|う}み{出|だ}す: to generate ideas\n- {利益|りえき}を{生|う}み{出|だ}す: to generate profit\n- {価値|かち}を{生|う}み{出|だ}す: to create value\n- {作品|さくひん}を{生|う}み{出|だ}す: to produce works\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {生|う}み{出|だ}す: to create, produce (emphasizes bringing something new into being)\n- {作|つく}る: to make (general, broader use)\n- {創造|そうぞう}する: to create (formal, emphasizes originality)",
